 R←Test_UC_055(stopFlag batchFlag);C;cfg;folder;log;msg;parms;rc;res;stop;success;tempDir;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise ]Cider.AddTatinDependencies -target= in both forms of the dependency settings:
⍝ * "dependencies" uses the old form: the target is added to "tatin" as "mypackages=Foo"
⍝ * "dependencies_dev" uses the new form: the target goes into "tatinTarget", "tatin" is left alone
⍝ Finally a dependency setting without a folder: the user declines to edit the project config file.
⍝ *** WARNING: want to rename this fn? Keep in mind to rename its folder under "Tests/" as well:
⍝ ***          the test data is located via this function's own name (∆GetTestPath⊃⎕SI).
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :If 0=IsDotNetAvailable
     R←T._NotApplicable ⋄ →0
 :EndIf

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP' ⋄ 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 folder←∆GetTestPath⊃⎕SI
 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 tempDir ⎕NCOPY⍠1⊢folder,'/*'

 parms←##.Cider.CreateOpenParms''
 parms.folder←∊⎕NPARTS tempDir
 parms.noPkgLoad←0
 parms.batch←1
 parms.ignoreUserExec←1

 C←∆GetRefToCommTools

 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'ChangeCurrentDir@' 'n'
 (success log)←##.Cider.OpenProject parms
 →T.GoToTidyUp~success
 →T.GoToTidyUp∨/'ERROR'⍷log

 stop←0

⍝ Old form
 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'AddTatinDeps@' 'y'
 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'LoadTatinDependenciesAfterAdding@' 'y'
 (rc msg res)←stop ∆UCMD'AddTatinDependencies FilesAndDirs "',tempDir,'" -target=Foo'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢msg
 cfg←##.Cider.ReadProjectConfig tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp'mypackages=Foo'≢cfg.CIDER.dependencies.tatin
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠cfg.CIDER.dependencies.⎕NC⊂'tatinTarget'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 9≠⌊#.TEMP.⎕NC⊂'Foo'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 9≠⌊#.TEMP.Foo.⎕NC⊂'FilesAndDirs'

⍝ New form
 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'AddTatinDeps@' 'y'
 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'LoadTatinDependenciesAfterAdding@' 'y'
 (rc msg res)←stop ∆UCMD'AddTatinDependencies APLTreeUtils2 "',tempDir,'" -development -target=Goo'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢msg
 cfg←##.Cider.ReadProjectConfig tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp('devpackages' 'Goo')≢cfg.CIDER.dependencies_dev.(tatin tatinTarget)
 →T.GoToTidyUp'mypackages=Foo'≢cfg.CIDER.dependencies.tatin
 →T.GoToTidyUp 9≠⌊#.TEMP.⎕NC⊂'Goo'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 9≠⌊#.TEMP.Goo.⎕NC⊂'APLTreeUtils2'

⍝ No folder defined, and the user declines to edit the project config file
 cfg.CIDER.dependencies_dev.(tatin tatinTarget)←'' ''
 cfg ##.Cider.WriteProjectConfig tempDir
 C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'EditProjectConfig@' 'n'
 (rc msg res)←stop ∆UCMD'AddTatinDependencies APLTreeUtils2 "',tempDir,'" -development'
 →T.GoToTidyUp rc≠0
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢msg
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Cancelled by user'⍷res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 C.Cleanup
 {}∆LINK'Break' '#.TEMP'
 FilesAndDirs.RmDir tempDir,'/..'
⍝Done
